utation":"17000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1028905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[43,49,83,86,77,78],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"100","reputation":"17000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1028905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1065","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[43,49,83,86,77,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1028905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[43,49,83,86,77,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1028905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东吴的谋士、重臣，为人刻苦爱学，东吴第一学者。孙权继位不久广纳贤士期间跟随孙权，为内政处理定夺方面做出了巨大的贡献。赤壁之前期间，负责将黄盖的诈降书献给曹操，曹操并不相信，但其机敏的辩论下使得曹操完全信服。愤怒的刘备前来伐吴时，面对没有主见的孙权，大力推荐了陆逊担当都督，间接促使了夷陵之战的胜利。","tc":"東吳的謀士、重臣，為人刻苦愛學，東吳第一學者。孫權繼位不久廣納賢士期間跟隨孫權，為內政處理定奪方面做出了巨大的貢獻。赤壁之前期間，負責將黃蓋的詐降書獻給曹操，曹操并不相信，但其機敏的辯論下使得曹操完全信服。憤怒的劉備前來伐吳時，面對沒有主見的孫權，大力推薦了陸遜擔當都督，間接促使了夷陵之戰的勝利。","en":"A strategist and senior minister of Wu, the foremost scholar of the kingdom. He joined Sun Quan shortly after Sun Quan's succession, when the new lord was broadly recruiting talent, and made enormous contributions to internal governance and policy-making. Before Red Cliffs, he delivered Huang Gai's feigned surrender letter to Cao Cao. When Cao Cao doubted the letter's authenticity, Kan Ze's quick and clever argument persuaded him completely. When a furious Liu Bei came to invade Wu and Sun Quan was at a loss, Kan Ze strongly recommended Lu Xun as Viceroy, indirectly contributing to the victory at Yiling.","jp":"東呉の謀臣、重臣。刻苦勉励に励み、東呉随一の学者と称された。孫権が家督を継いで広く賢士を求めた折に出仕し、内政の取りまとめや裁決において多大な貢献を果たした。赤壁の戦いの前には黄蓋の偽りの降伏状を曹操へ届ける役目を担い、当初疑っていた曹操を機敏な弁舌によって完全に信服させた。怒りに燃える劉備が呉へ侵攻してきた際には、決断を下しかねていた孫権に対して陸遜を都督に推挙し、夷陵の戦いにおける勝利へと間接的に導いた。","kr":"동오의 모사이자 중신. 성품이 근면하고 학문을 좋아하여 동오 최고의 학자로 불렸다. 손권이 즉위한 직후 널리 현사를 구할 때 손권을 섬기기 시작했으며, 내정 처리와 주요 사안을 결정하는 데 지대한 공헌을 세웠다. 적벽대전 직전, 황개의 거짓 투항서를 조조에게 전하는 중책을 맡았다. 조조는 처음에는 믿지 않았으나, 기민한 언변으로 조조를 완전히 납득시켰다. 격분한 유비가 오나라를 정벌하러 왔을 때 갈피를 잡지 못하던 손권에게 육손을 도독으로 적극 천거하여, 간접적으로 이릉대전의 승리를 이끌어 냈다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10194","remark":"","surname":"阚","surnameTc":"闞","surnameEn":"Kan","surnameJp":"闞","surnameKr":"감","surnameOther":"","name":"泽","nameTc":"澤","nameEn":"Ze","nameJp":"沢","nameKr":"택","nameOther":"","word":"德润","wordTc":"德潤","wordEn":"Derun","wordJp":"徳潤","wordKr":"덕윤","wordOther":"","icon":"阚泽","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"201","city":"CS1065","gender":"0","rule":"43","force":"49","wise":"83","politics":"86","charm":"77","will":"78","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"12","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"13/13/13/13/13/81/33/13","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1019405","debateSoul":"1001405","warSoulPoint":"1800","battleSoulPoint":"2400","debateSoulPoint":"6800","strategy":"1004208","strategy2":"1000105","professions":"0/0/0/1/1/1/0/3/5/4/0/0/0/2/0/0/3/5/4/2/1/0/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"84","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4000","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birt